    "problems": "The paper does not test the original weak-label-only setup or report PGR. No uncertainty estimates are stated for the tabulated speedups. The tested comparisons use task labels alongside distillation, so they do not isolate weak supervision as the sole source of learning.",
    "rows_left_out": "Omitted Figure 7 entropy, CKA and KL diagnostics, gradient-norm plots, and method-specific warm-start, stop-rule, label-smoothing and KL-direction ablations: these do not measure a listed claim version's weak-to-strong performance effect. No Table 1, Table 2 or Table 3 target-speedup result was omitted.",
